### List cities
GET http://localhost:5000/api/cities?page=1&limit=10

### Search cities
GET http://localhost:5000/api/cities?q=Mumbai

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/cities/cities-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/cities
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Surat",
  "state": "Gujarat",
  "active": true
}
